  "prefLabel": "Ed 323.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 323.01 Purpose. The purpose of Ed 323 is to implement the provisions of RSA 198:15-hh, relative to providing annual grants to meet the costs of leasing permanent space in buildings for chartered public schools authorized under RSA 194-B:3-a.\n\nSource. #13207, eff 5-20-21; ss by #13720, eff 8-12-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed300.html"
}
